CodeSystem: DMEDPrescriptionDoseFormCS
Id: dmed-prescription-dose-form-cs
Title: "DMED prescription dose form"
Description: "Dose form identifiers of the DMED prescriptions API (`dosage_form_id`, dictionary `GET /api/prescriptions/v1/dosage-forms`), with their Russian names as DMED shows them. Exported from the DMED test environment on 2026-11-03."
* insert OriginalCodeSystemDraft(dmed-prescription-dose-form-cs)
* ^language = #ru
* ^publisher = "Uzinfocom"

